{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to defy the law of gravity in GravBot, the mobile classic, available on desktop systems for the first time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GravBot is a physics-based puzzle platformer, where you decide which way is &quot;up&quot; as a little robot falls and pivots through each level. Collect all the batteries to win, but watch out. A wrong move could be deadly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level presents a unique challenge. Find the right path, avoid enemies, spike traps and laser beams. Use levers, buttons and elevators to solve the puzzles. GravBot is fun for all ages, but with the game's physics, the simplest solution isn't always what it seems! Challenge yourself to earn a bronze, silver or gold metal for the smallest number of pivots needed to complete the level.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Good Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127590/70117d92ac7226a2dd71e7e26568b8b408221b4e.jpg"},{"name":"Answer To What?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127590/5c6d486117a504c5bed399bce050c71a62002582.jpg"},{"name":"Above And Beyond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127590/f57674a2bc3add53a3b6430a91a6da39079d6501.jpg"},{"name":"Cleanup Crew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127590/33a01fe39b5bd7bd0d7a9c637b7f96fb8e7c9f1a.jpg"},{"name":"One Bot's Trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127590/18f7d0f6f07a901ad4cd63cfd0804ea323aa4fc2.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Junkyard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127590/95380e82ddad320840dee78fc4fa100223ab0050.jpg"},{"name":"Energized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127590/cc1165224bdc3393ea7b586852902f970a100b6e.jpg"},{"name":"Recharged","p